DTEND:20261209T010700Z
SUMMARY:New moon in 2 hours. Choose your 12/12 wish.
DESCRIPTION:New moons are for planting. Full moons are for letting go.\n\n
 1. One wish only. Write it in the present tense: "I have"\, not "I want".
 \n2. Put the note where you will see it on the 12th.\n3. Don't tell anyon
 e yet.\n\nListen: https://astromind2026-ship-it.github.io/rose-2027/liste
 n/new-moon/
URL:https://astromind2026-ship-it.github.io/rose-2027/listen/new-moon/
CATEGORIES:New Moon
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:New moon in 2 hours. Choose your 12/12 wish.
TRIGGER:-PT120M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eve-1212-2026@manifestwithrose
DTSTAMP:20261116T000000Z
DTSTART:20261211T210000
DTEND:20261211T211500
SUMMARY:Tomorrow\, 12:12 happens twice.
DESCRIPTION:Most people only catch one.\n\nTonight:\n1. Read your new-moon
  wish once before bed.\n2. You don't need to set alarms. Both 12:12s are 
 already in this calendar.\n3. Sleep. The first one comes while you rest.\
 n\nListen: https://astromind2026-ship-it.github.io/rose-2027/listen/eve-1
 212/
