DTSTAMP:20261116T000000Z
DTSTART:20261212T001200
DTEND:20261212T002700
SUMMARY:12:12. The first one.
DESCRIPTION:If you're awake: one slow breath in\, say the wish once\, go b
 ack to sleep.\n\nIf you slept through this\, you are not late. The second
  one is at noon.\n\nListen: https://astromind2026-ship-it.github.io/rose-
 2027/listen/first-1212/
URL:https://astromind2026-ship-it.github.io/rose-2027/listen/first-1212/
CATEGORIES:12/12 Portal
