DESCRIPTION:At 12:12 exactly:\n1. Read the wish out loud\, once.\n2. Say "
 thank you" as if it is already done.\n\nThat's all. No ritual needed.\n\n
 Listen: https://astromind2026-ship-it.github.io/rose-2027/listen/second-1
 212/
