DTSTAMP:20261116T000000Z
DTSTART:20261221T205000Z
DTEND:20261221T210500Z
SUMMARY:Solstice in 2 hours. The year turns here.
DESCRIPTION:North of the equator this is the longest night. From here the 
 light comes back.\n\n1. Name one thing you are done carrying.\n2. Write i
 t down\, fold it once\, throw it away.\n3. Light a candle or a lamp and l
 eave it on for ten minutes.\n\nListen: https://astromind2026-ship-it.gith
 ub.io/rose-2027/listen/solstice/
