DTSTAMP:20261116T000000Z
DTSTART:20261224T012800Z
DTEND:20261224T014300Z
SUMMARY:Cold Moon peaks in 2 hours. Let one thing go before Christmas.
DESCRIPTION:The last full moon of 2026\, and a supermoon. Full moons are f
 or releasing\, not asking.\n\n1. Finish this sentence: "I am not taking _
 __ into 2027."\n2. Say it once\, out loud.\n3. If the sky is clear\, look
  at the moon. Thirty seconds counts.\n\nListen: https://astromind2026-shi
 p-it.github.io/rose-2027/listen/cold-moon/
URL:https://astromind2026-ship-it.github.io/rose-2027/listen/cold-moon/
CATEGORIES:Cold Moon
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
